extends ../../../../../designs/mockup-kit/page.pug

include ../mixins/admin.pug

block title
  | icloud-backup — admin · UI mockups

//-
  The read-only admin page: a table of everyone's backup, then the presets for
  libraries that existed before the app, and the form that adds one. Copy and
  sample data are in src/data/admin.mjs.

block page
  +mockPage('max-w-[1760px]')(class='page')
    +mockHead({ eyebrow: 'icloud-backup · /admin', title: 'Admin', back: true })
      p For lilnas-auth admins. A compact, read-only table at 1280 that becomes a list of cards at 390. Below it, #[+code('Existing libraries')]: the presets that link a lilnas email to a folder and an Immich library, and a form that adds one. #[+code('Add library')] is the one accent button; #[+code('Remove')] is a red outline because it is the only destructive thing here. Each state is a frame showing 1280 and 390 side by side.

    - const d = { copy, cols, rows, libraries, form }
    each fr, i in frames
      +mockFrame(fr.key, fr.label, { num: String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0'), caption: fr.caption })
        div(class='flex flex-wrap items-start gap-x-8 gap-y-6')
          div(class='flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3')
            +adminScreen('desktop', fr, d)
            +frameLabel Desktop · 1280
          div(class='flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3')
            +adminScreen('mobile', fr, d)
            +frameLabel Mobile · 390
